{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53986","headline":"偈 三 · 智真","name":"偈 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忍仙林下坐禅时，曾被歌王割截肢。\n况我圣朝无此事，只今休道亦何悲。\n（见《景德传灯录》卷九、《五灯会元》卷四）（按：《祖堂集》卷十七以「心本」、「忍仙」二首作正原偈。\n《淳熙三山志》卷三七则以正原「沧溟几度变桑山」一偈归智真，今皆不取。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"智真","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53986.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53986","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}